      "writtenOn": "2024-07-01T18:27:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe that checking this based on the image variation may lead to false positive for module types that do not implement image mutator. e.g. for Java modules this will return `true` even if `vendor: true`, as the vendor variant is not created and `ctx.Module().ImageVariation().Variation` will always be `CoreVariation` (i.e. an empty string).",
